# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# PanicOS: nothing on a disk is mounted unless the operator mounts it.
#
# The image ships no automounter. This is the second guard: if udisks2 is
# ever installed on a persistent stick (gvfs and most file managers pull it
# in), it must still not mount filesystems on its own.
SUBSYSTEM=="block", ENV{UDISKS_AUTO}="0"
